    "body": "The Shoot crash came from removing four bytes from the caller stack after replacing a CALL with a JMP. That adjustment is gone. Shoot is now part of Fixed Command Menu rather than an Irvine-only setting, and Shot is displayed as Shoot. Queue, ammo/ATB share, same-turn return, next-turn lock, and combined command-builder checks pass statically; battle acceptance remains.",
